          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lazy people who refuse to work are only killing themselves; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all they do is think about what they would like to have. The righteous, however, can give, and give generously.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
